{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5adf3394-9dfc-8fab-9e7c-0d4a06e2de8d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:00:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenas tardes, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. [pause] I'm calling about noise. There's a group of motorcycles that keeps revving outside every evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Every evening, you said? Where is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 9 Broadway. In the North End. I manage the building, so I'm not even there all day, but the tenants keep calling me. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me a little. You manage the building at 9 Broadway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Nine Broadway. Sorry, my reception is awful in here. [pause] Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you now. So motorcycles, outside the building. What time of day are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Evenings. Like five, six o'clock, sometimes it goes past eight. They sit there and rev the engines, over and over. It's been going on since Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday, so that's a full week now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a week today. [sighs] I have people with little kids in there who can't get them down at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that would wear on anybody. Do you know if it's the same group each night? Same bikes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Looks like the same ones, [inaudible] maybe six or seven of them. They park along the curb and just hang out. I don't know who they are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Are they blocking anything, a driveway, a hydrant, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've seen. Just loud. Honestly, should I be calling the police non-emergency line instead of you? I wasn't sure which one is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. For something happening in the moment, like when they're out there revving, the police non-emergency line is the best way to get someone to actually come by. I can log your complaint here too so there's a record that it's ongoing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So both, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both is fine. The call to police gets someone out there while it's happening, and what I take down here shows it's a pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. [sighs] I just figured somebody would've dealt with it by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get your name for the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fatima Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:58:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Fatima. And a callback number, in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. [line breaks up] Sorry, did that cut out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got it all. I'll note it's every evening since Monday, motorcycles, revving, at 9 Broadway, and that you're the property manager."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Sorry, I'm a little scattered today. I've also got a book report due Monday and I haven't even picked a book. It's a biography. I keep putting it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a book report, okay. Is that for a class you're taking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a night class. Anyway, not your problem. I'm just tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. If you want a biography, the library on Spring Street can point you to something short, that might save you some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, maybe I'll stop by. Thanks. So, the noise thing, what happens now with the complaint?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It gets logged and routed so the right office sees it. If it keeps up, the more times it's reported, the stronger the record. So do call the police line when they're out there, each time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll tell my tenants to do the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with the book, and I hope it quiets down tonight. Take care."
    }
  ],
